<!-- ============ 03 ROLLBACK TO ============ -->
<section class="sect reveal reveal-d1" id="error-handling">
  <span class="sect-tag">03 · ROLLBACK TO · A10</span>
  <h2>回滚到<em>指定 SAVEPOINT</em>。</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    嵌套场景之外,你也可以 <b>显式</b> 标记 SAVEPOINT 然后选择性回退。
    典型用法: <b>幂等重试</b>——每次循环新建一个 savepoint,失败回退到该点重试,而不放弃整个外层事务。
  </p>

  <div class="e2f">
    <div class="e2f-card is-bad">
      <div class="e2f-mark">✗ 反模式</div>
      <div class="e2f-title">每次重试都重开事务</div>
<pre class="code-block"><span class="kw">for</span> attempt <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">3</span>):
    <span class="kw">try</span>:
        <span class="kw">with</span> backend.<span class="fn">transaction</span>():
            <span class="fn">do_part_a</span>()        <span class="cm"># 每次都重做</span>
            <span class="fn">do_part_b</span>()
            <span class="fn">do_part_c</span>()        <span class="cm"># ← 容易失败的</span>
            <span class="kw">break</span>
    <span class="kw">except</span> <span class="cls">TransientError</span>:
        <span class="kw">continue</span></pre>
      <div class="e2f-foot">
        每次 part_a/part_b 都重新跑一遍 · 浪费 I/O · 大事务过期风险增加
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="e2f-arrow">→</div>

    <div class="e2f-card is-good">
      <div class="e2f-mark">✓ 正确做法</div>
      <div class="e2f-title">外层一个事务 + 内层重试 SAVEPOINT</div>
<pre class="code-block"><span class="kw">with</span> backend.<span class="fn">transaction</span>():
    <span class="fn">do_part_a</span>()                <span class="cm"># 只跑一次</span>
    <span class="fn">do_part_b</span>()                <span class="cm"># 只跑一次</span>

    <span class="kw">for</span> attempt <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">3</span>):
        <span class="kw">try</span>:
            <span class="kw">with</span> backend.<span class="fn">transaction</span>():   <span class="hl">SAVEPOINT</span>
                <span class="fn">do_part_c</span>()        <span class="cm"># 只重试这部分</span>
                <span class="kw">break</span>
        <span class="kw">except</span> <span class="cls">TransientError</span>:
            <span class="kw">continue</span>             <span class="cm"># ROLLBACK TO + 重试</span>
    <span class="kw">else</span>:
        <span class="kw">raise</span> <span class="cls">RuntimeError</span>(<span class="str">"重试 3 次仍失败"</span>)</pre>
      <div class="e2f-foot">
        只回退 part_c · part_a/b 已落到外层事务 · 最终 COMMIT 一次
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

